    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to bring to the market number 3 Great Western Villas. Behind the red brick facade this lovely home will appeal to a first buyers. Modernisation is needed.Lovely original features include a focal point stone hearth in the siting and high ceilings on the grond floor.There is a south facing walled courtyard with lovely view onto the Dublin Mountains. This property  is  ideally positioned in Great Western Villas close to Phibsboro Village, within walking distance of  a host of shops, pubs and restaurants. There is parking on-street.\n\nThe accommodation comprises of: entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/ dining room and bathroom, whilst upstairs there are two bedrooms. Residents also benefit from a communal garden at the end of the row of homes. \n\nThe location is superb with excellent educational facilities nearby including the new TUD Grangegorman.  Dublin City centre is provided for with an excellent local bus service and a Luas stop at TUD Grangegorman.\n\nViewing is highly recommended for those looking to set up home in the highly sought-after location.\n\nPlease contact DNG on 01 8300989 Local Agents Brian McGee MIPAV, Ciarán Jones MIPAV, Michelle Keeley MIPAV, Isabel O'Neill and Vincent Mullen MIPAV and Leah Barry."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.38m x 1.13m\nEntrance hall with laminate floor.\n\nSitting Room - 4.43m x 3.93m\nSpacious and bright sitting room with high ceilings and good light.There is a focal point fireplace, there is a access to good storage with shelving and hotpress.\n\nKitchen/dining area - 3.44m x 2.14m\nKitchen/dining area which faces onto back courtyard.Kitchen with floor and wall presses, there is access to understairs storage.\n\nBack hall - 0.90m x 0.91\nBack hall with tiled floor , there is access to back courtyard.\n\nBathroom - 1.4m x 1.59m\nBathroom with W/C and W.H.B and bath which is fitted with Triton T-90 shower over.\n\nLanding - 0.93m x 0.97m\nLanding area with good light.There is carpet floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.6m x 2.89m\nBedroom located at the back of the property with carpet floor and built-in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.79m x 4m\nSpacious bedroom with built-in storage located at the front of the house.\n\nOutside - \nWalled courtyard with south facing aspect.\n\n"
      },
      {
